The discussion of sounds in Nethack got me to write NHSound, a simple TSR
(Terminate Stay Resident) program to add sounds to Nethack on PC. It keeps
track of the messages Nethack shows on the uppermost row of the screen and if
it notices a message that is in its .cnf file it plays the .voc file associated
with it.
  It requires a soundcard and works at least on my SounbBlaster Pro (it should
work on regular SB too).

If anyone is interested, I will put it in some ftp-place as soon as I get it
completed.

